HST Office: ribbon customization and the "Sử dụng gần đây" (recently used) tab, HST-owned code.

- hst/ (new top-level gbuild module, LicenseRef-HST-Proprietary, hst/README.md):
  - hst/ribbon/core: standard C++ only (no office or toolkit header). JSON reader/writer; the default and
    effective layouts; custom-<app>.json (tolerant parse: a broken entry is skipped and the default kept, limits
    on tabs, groups, commands, labels and ids), its merge into the default ribbon and diff against it; the
    export/import bundle of every app; the customize dialog's edits (custom tabs and groups, add, remove,
    move, rename, hide, reset one tab); the usage history (30 days, at most 300 commands, score
    count x 0.5^(age/7), documented noise list); the usage store (the tab's switch and every app's
    history without I/O: switching the tab off stops recording and keeps every history, only "Xóa lịch sử"
    clears them); the recently used tab's groups by home tab.
    StaticLibrary_hst_ribbon_core, CppunitTest_hst_ribbon_core.
  - hst/ribbon/lo: the adapter linked into sfx (hst-ribbon-custom-hooks.patch). The controller reads the
    built Tabbed ribbon (v3 groups via their "hst-ribbon-layout" spec) and applies the customization before the
    first layout: hidden groups leave the group box, hidden commands hide, reordered commands get a spec without
    fixed rows, custom groups and tabs are generated .ui documents in the v3 group format built by VclBuilder (so
    commands get their usual controllers, KeyTips and the v3 fit). The recently used tab stands after Trang đầu
    and is rebuilt when shown after the history or the width changed, with as many commands as fit. The usage
    recorder batches writes (60 s timer and at exit). The customize dialog and the UNO service
    vn.hasontech.hst.RibbonCustomization (XJob, used by Tùy chọn › HST Office › Ribbon).
- sfx2/uiconfig/ui/hstribboncustomizedialog.ui (new): the "Tùy chỉnh ribbon" dialog.

