+// HST Office: the UNO service behind Tùy chọn › HST Office › Ribbon (the extension's options page,
+// ribbon_options.py). XJob::execute takes "Action":
+//   "getRecentEnabled"  -> the recently used tab's switch (boolean)
+//   "setRecentEnabled"  with "Enabled" (boolean): switches it; the ribbons are rebuilt
+//   "clearHistory"      forgets every app's usage history (memory and profile)
